{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\eng\\073.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "h. Below is the step-by-step procedure to perform CPR. Rearrange", "conf": 0.946, "box": [[47, 150], [853, 144], [854, 177], [47, 183]]}, {"text": "Procedural writing", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[912, 142], [1111, 144], [1111, 174], [912, 172]]}, {"text": "provides a series of", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[913, 178], [1106, 174], [1107, 202], [914, 206]]}, {"text": "the steps in the correct order.", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[95, 191], [453, 190], [453, 220], [95, 221]]}, {"text": "precise, sequenced", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[913, 209], [1104, 207], [1104, 234], [913, 236]]}, {"text": "Check for breathing. If they are not breathing, start CPR.", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[154, 242], [824, 239], [824, 276], [154, 279]]}, {"text": "steps or directions", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[914, 239], [1099, 237], [1099, 264], [914, 266]]}, {"text": "that explain how to", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[915, 270], [1107, 270], [1107, 296], [915, 296]]}, {"text": "Call 1122 or other ambulance service or ask someone else to.", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[158, 301], [886, 297], [886, 329], [158, 334]]}, {"text": "do something,while", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[915, 299], [1118, 301], [1118, 328], [915, 325]]}, {"text": "reaching the outcome", "conf": 0.862, "box": [[915, 331], [1135, 331], [1135, 358], [915, 358]]}, {"text": "Perform two rescue breaths.", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[160, 359], [497, 359], [497, 388], [160, 388]]}, {"text": "successfully.", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[913, 361], [1038, 361], [1038, 391], [913, 391]]}, {"text": "Repeat until an ambulance or automated external defibrillator arrives.", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[160, 415], [981, 410], [981, 443], [160, 448]]}, {"text": "Perform 30 chest compressions.", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[160, 473], [543, 475], [542, 504], [160, 502]]}, {"text": "Lay the person on their back and open their airway", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[140, 530], [770, 530], [770, 559], [140, 559]]}, {"text": "Use of Language I", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[126, 601], [435, 610], [433, 649], [125, 641]]}, {"text": "Adverbs of Place,Time,Frequency and Manner", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[152, 705], [752, 707], [752, 737], [152, 735]]}, {"text": "An adverb is a word or phrase that modifies or qualifies an", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[77, 758], [782, 760], [782, 789], [76, 787]]}, {"text": "adjective, verb, or other adverb or a word group, expressing a", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[80, 792], [813, 795], [813, 828], [79, 825]]}, {"text": "Learn It!", "conf": 0.85, "box": [[953, 797], [1048, 794], [1048, 822], [953, 824]]}, {"text": "relation of place, time, circumstance, manner, cause, degree.", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[80, 830], [791, 834], [791, 863], [79, 859]]}, {"text": "An adverb is a word that", "conf": 0.824, "box": [[861, 831], [1111, 829], [1111, 853], [862, 855]]}, {"text": "Adverb of Place tells us where an action takes place.", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[80, 865], [717, 870], [717, 899], [79, 894]]}, {"text": "describes a verb, and", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[860, 861], [1074, 859], [1074, 885], [861, 887]]}, {"text": "Adverb of Time tells us when something happened or when", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[80, 900], [805, 908], [805, 938], [79, 930]]}, {"text": "adjective or another adverb.", "conf": 0.868, "box": [[862, 894], [1141, 889], [1142, 915], [863, 920]]}, {"text": "Adverbs provide such", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[862, 923], [1080, 921], [1080, 948], [863, 950]]}, {"text": "someone did something.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[79, 936], [388, 939], [387, 970], [78, 966]]}, {"text": "information as how,when", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[863, 952], [1131, 951], [1131, 977], [863, 978]]}, {"text": "Adverb of Frequency describes how often something occurs,", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[81, 971], [814, 980], [814, 1009], [80, 1001]]}, {"text": "and where.", "conf": 0.83, "box": [[863, 983], [979, 983], [979, 1009], [863, 1009]]}, {"text": "either in definite, or indefinite terms.", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[83,